{
    "title": "Qibla Finder Compass 100%",
    "description": "Find Qibla direction \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0644\u0629 with 100% accuracy for your prayers. To find Qibla direction, you don't need an internet connection! \r\n\r\nLow size app that shows 100% Qibla Direction worldwide. Simple & Smart Qibla compass.\r\n\r\n100% Qibla Finder helps Muslims find the Kibla all over the world. The Qibla direction \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0644\u0629 -direction of the Kaaba in Mecca (Makkah)- is indicated by an arrow on the map, so you can adjust your direction before you start your prayer.\r\n\r\nQibla is one of the rules that every Muslim should pay attention to. With our app, you can find the qibla accurately wherever you are. So you can start the prayer without losing location with smart Qibla Compass.\r\n\r\n100% Qibla Finder: Compass, Direction All Features\r\n\r\n\u2713 You don't need the internet to see where Makkah is. 100% Qibla Finder shows you where Mecca is located even in offline mode using its compass function.\r\n\r\n\u2713 Your direction is located with precision thanks to the GPS function of the application. To find Qibla \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0644\u0629, your phone's GPS function must be working properly.\r\n\r\n\u2713 You can re-detect your position with the \"Find my position\" function to be sure of the Kaaba.\r\n\r\n\u2713 You can share 100% Qibla Compass on Facebook and other social networks with your friends.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n\u2713 Select from various map or compass modes\r\n\u2713 Customize your location marker\r\n\u2713 Locate the nearest mosques to your current location\r\n\r\nYou should hold your phone on a flat surface and keep it away from electromagnetic fields and metallic objects. If necessary, you can manually rearrange your location by tapping the marker.\r\n\r\nTo use the product, your phone must be away from magnetic fields. If there is too much of a magnetic field around, you might have trouble finding your way. The presence of a GPS jamming device around you can also affect steering. If you think you are not getting the correct result, you can try again at a time when there is no electronic device. However, you need to make sure that your phone is working properly. A problem with your phone can cause problems. Don't forget to activate Google GPS features. If you do not allow the location of the app, you may experience issues. So make sure you allow everything.\r\n\r\nYou can also use our product as a compass. With the help of your phone's sensors, you will have used one of the most accurate compass apps. The compass features will work even if you are offline. We remind you that you must be absolutely sure that there is no electromagnetic field around you in order to avoid problems with the functions of the compass.\r\n\r\nIn order to get the best results for \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0644\u0629 Qibla direction, never forget the condition that you get the right result once. On your next attempts, run the product when you get the correct result. So you will continue to use the product without any problem.\r\n\r\nDon't forget to allow Google services to make sure the app works properly. Thus, you will be able to access all the features without any problems. If you do not give permission, it is quite natural to experience disruptions and problems while working.\r\n\r\nPrivacy & Terms : https://www.muslimassistant.com/privacy-terms.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find Qibla direction \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0644\u0629 with 100% accuracy for your prayers. To find Qibla direction, you don&#39;t need an internet connection! <br><br>Low size app that shows 100% Qibla Direction worldwide. Simple &amp; Smart Qibla compass.<br><br>100% Qibla Finder helps Muslims find the Kibla all over the world. The Qibla direction \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0644\u0629 -direction of the Kaaba in Mecca (Makkah)- is indicated by an arrow on the map, so you can adjust your direction before you start your prayer.<br><br>Qibla is one of the rules that every Muslim should pay attention to. With our app, you can find the qibla accurately wherever you are. So you can start the prayer without losing location with smart Qibla Compass.<br><br>100% Qibla Finder: Compass, Direction All Features<br><br>\u2713 You don&#39;t need the internet to see where Makkah is. 100% Qibla Finder shows you where Mecca is located even in offline mode using its compass function.<br><br>\u2713 Your direction is located with precision thanks to the GPS function of the application. To find Qibla \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0644\u0629, your phone&#39;s GPS function must be working properly.<br><br>\u2713 You can re-detect your position with the &quot;Find my position&quot; function to be sure of the Kaaba.<br><br>\u2713 You can share 100% Qibla Compass on Facebook and other social networks with your friends.<br><br>Additional features include:<br>\u2713 Select from various map or compass modes<br>\u2713 Customize your location marker<br>\u2713 Locate the nearest mosques to your current location<br><br>You should hold your phone on a flat surface and keep it away from electromagnetic fields and metallic objects. If necessary, you can manually rearrange your location by tapping the marker.<br><br>To use the product, your phone must be away from magnetic fields. If there is too much of a magnetic field around, you might have trouble finding your way. The presence of a GPS jamming device around you can also affect steering. If you think you are not getting the correct result, you can try again at a time when there is no electronic device. However, you need to make sure that your phone is working properly. A problem with your phone can cause problems. Don&#39;t forget to activate Google GPS features. If you do not allow the location of the app, you may experience issues. So make sure you allow everything.<br><br>You can also use our product as a compass. With the help of your phone&#39;s sensors, you will have used one of the most accurate compass apps. The compass features will work even if you are offline. We remind you that you must be absolutely sure that there is no electromagnetic field around you in order to avoid problems with the functions of the compass.<br><br>In order to get the best results for \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0644\u0629 Qibla direction, never forget the condition that you get the right result once. On your next attempts, run the product when you get the correct result. So you will continue to use the product without any problem.<br><br>Don&#39;t forget to allow Google services to make sure the app works properly. Thus, you will be able to access all the features without any problems. If you do not give permission, it is quite natural to experience disruptions and problems while working.<br><br>Privacy &amp; Terms : https://www.muslimassistant.com/privacy-terms.html",
